Ready, and...

00:23:20.860 --> 00:23:22.540
Surface d'un lac.

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:23.990
Non, non.

00:23:23.990 --> 00:23:25.710
Surface d'un lac.

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:26.820
Everyone.

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:30.140
<b>Come again soon.</b>

